「田需與寡人約，而犀首之燕、趙，是欺我也。」怒而不聽其事。齊聞犀首之北，使人以事委焉。犀首遂行，三國相事皆斷於犀首。軫遂至秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"秦惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"x9j_eu1_vck","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"5an_r55_hee","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"陳軫","kind":"person","person_id":"bvi_h86_vk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"陳軫","kind":"person","person_id":"bvi_h86_vk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":"9qj_prl_ehx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":"9qj_prl_ehx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"軫","kind":"person","person_id":"bvi_h86_vk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"軫","kind":"person","person_id":"bvi_h86_vk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"軫","kind":"person","person_id":"bvi_h86_vk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":"9qj_prl_ehx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"陳軫","kind":"person","person_id":"bvi_h86_vk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":"9qj_prl_ehx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m053-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"田需