"status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p057","text":"義渠君朝於魏。犀首聞張儀復相秦，害之。犀首乃謂義渠君曰：「道遠不得復過，請謁事情。」曰：「中國無事，秦得燒掇焚杅君之國；有事，秦將輕使重幣事君之國。」其後五國伐秦。會陳軫謂秦王曰：「義渠君者，蠻夷之賢君也，不如賂之以撫其志。」秦王曰：「善。」乃以文繡千純，婦女百人遺義渠君。義渠君致群臣而謀曰：「此公孫衍所謂邪？」乃起兵襲秦，大敗秦人李伯之下。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"義渠君","kind":"person","person_id":"uw3_qbv_8o0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":"9qj_prl_ehx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"5an_r55_hee","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":"9qj_prl_ehx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"義渠君","kind":"person","person_id":"uw3_qbv_8o0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"uw3_qbv_8o0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"陳軫","kind":"person","person_id":"bvi_h86_vk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"4i4_lmr_aap","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"義渠君","kind":"person","person_id":"uw3_qbv_8o0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"4i4_lmr_aap","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0128","start":128,"end":132,"surface":"